(SBA 7\(a\) Business Acquisition Lending - Program Summary \(fixture\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(This summary describes the standard terms a lender applies to a change-of-ownership loan) Tj T*
(under the 7\(a\) program. It is a fixture for testing and not guidance.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. Maximum loan amount. The maximum gross loan amount under 7\(a\) is $5,000,000. The) Tj T*
(guaranteed portion is 75% for loans above $150,000 and 85% for loans of $150,000 or less.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
