stream
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 750 Td 14 TL
(2. Equity injection) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(For a complete change of ownership the borrower must inject equity of at least 10% of the) Tj T*
(total project cost. Seller debt may count toward the equity injection only when it is on) Tj T*
(full standby \(no payments of principal or interest\) for the entire term of the 7\(a\) loan,) Tj T*
(and only up to half of the required injection.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3. Maturity. Loans financing a business acquisition without real estate have a maximum) Tj T*
(maturity of 10 years. Where real estate is the largest component of the loan, the maturity) Tj T*
(may be up to 25 years.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
