stream
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 750 Td 14 TL
(4. Guarantees and collateral) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Each owner of 20% or more of the applicant business must provide an unlimited personal) Tj T*
(guarantee. The lender must take available collateral, including the assets of the business) Tj T*
(acquired, but a loan is not declined solely for lack of collateral.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5. Repayment ability. The lender must document that the business's historical and) Tj T*
(projected cash flow covers the proposed debt service. Lenders commonly require a debt) Tj T*
(service coverage ratio of at least 1.25 on a trailing twelve month basis.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(6. Guarantee fee. The upfront guarantee fee ranges from 2% to 3.75% of the guaranteed) Tj T*
(portion depending on loan size and maturity, and may be financed as part of the loan.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
